# VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client), like the projects' rest/*.rest files. `npm run dev` first.
# Run "login", then the other requests reuse its tokens.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@api = {{base}}/api/v1
# Seeded branch ids (fitmanager-infra/db/seeds/demo/001_branches_and_staff.sql). Rules come from the assignment at X-Branch-Id (D-034).
@hq = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@gulshan = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002

### Health and metrics (outside /api: not exposed through nginx)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

###
GET {{base}}/metrics

### @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "owner", "password": "Owner@123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.data.refresh_token}}

### Who am I: global rules + one assignment per branch, each with its rules
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rotate the refresh token (the old one stops working)
POST {{api}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "{{refresh}}" }

### Lookups
GET {{api}}/ddl?ddl_key=category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List: paging, search, filter, sort
GET {{api}}/items?offset=0&limit=5&search_text=alpha&status=Active&sort_by=amount&sort_order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Branch-Id: {{hq}}

### @name create
POST {{api}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Branch-Id: {{hq}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name_en": "Created From REST",
  "category_oid": "C1",
  "contact_mobile": "01712345678",
  "effective_date": "2026-01-15",
  "amount": 1250000,
  "status": "Active",
  "attachment": null,
  "lines": [{ "label": "Note", "value": "From requests.http" }]
}

###
@item = {{create.response.body.data.oid}}

### Validation errors, one per field
POST {{api}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Branch-Id: {{hq}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name_en": "", "contact_mobile": "123" }

### Server-side PDF (needs CHROME_PATH)
GET {{api}}/items/{{item}}/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Branch-Id: {{hq}}

### Export (format=csv | xlsx)
GET {{api}}/items/export?format=xlsx&status=Active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Branch-Id: {{hq}}

### Delete
DELETE {{api}}/items/{{item}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Branch-Id: {{hq}}

### Upload (type decided by content)
POST {{api}}/files/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="note.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4 sample
--b--

### One-time code: the code is in the dev server log (mail is logged, not sent)
# @name otp
POST {{api}}/otp/send
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "someone@example.com" }

###
POST {{api}}/otp/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otp_id": "{{otp.response.body.data.otp_id}}", "code": "000000" }

### Sign out of this session
POST {{api}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "{{refresh}}" }

### Public site groups (D-040): each group's landing section and page switches
GET {{api}}/public/site-groups

### Blog off the home page, its page kept (a required group answers 409)
PATCH {{api}}/hq/site-groups/blog
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Branch-Id: {{hq}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "section": false, "page": true }
